      "value": "@{5f30ecee654cd4491456a82f|full_name} This is how I control my imposters tbh, but I think the issue here is more about public avatars that people don't have access to do that, having a personal imposter for an avatar you used a lot but aren't the owner off would be a good feature to be fair, but also a lot of people don't know how to do what you've suggested, and those people would also benefit from this, being able to run it from in game rather than as it shows at point of upload would be useful for them too",
